# The completion mapping ignores the report: an aborted or cancelled remediation reads succeeded.
MODULE: OutcomeMatchesRemediationEveryReportSucceeds
TARGET: OutcomeMatchesRemediation
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: every terminal remediation report is recorded as succeeded
PERTURBS: Finish

--- FIND
            /\ opState' = [opState EXCEPT ![o] = StateOf(remResult[opSeen[o]])]
--- REPLACE
            /\ opState' = [opState EXCEPT ![o] = "Succeeded"]
--- END
